  (text "Note: Limit the input voltage to about 2 Vpp,\nand use R101/R103 to set a gain of 0.1 so as\nto avoid overloading the output transistors!"
    (at 15.24 43.18 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3eaf2f34-a245-49f2-bf9e-630d1f8d4ce5)
  )
  (text "C101, C102: Aluminum electrolytic, 25V or higher.\nC103-C115: Ceramic, X7R or Y5V, 25V or higher.\nAll resistors: 1.4 W, 1% metal film.\nRV101: 10k multiturn trimpot."
    (at 217.17 146.05 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 64edd57c-2bea-4522-912d-ae4ea939d755)
  )
  (text "Procedure:\n\nSet RV101 fully counterclockwise.\nShort-circuit J101.\nConnect ±6 V power supply to J102\nWith J101 shorted, adjust RV101 to give\n65 mV between TP101 and TP102.\n\nConnect AWG to J101. Connect oscilloscope\nchannel 1 to the AWG output and channel\n2 to TP103.\n\nUse 8R2 resistor as a dummy load in place\nof Device Under Test.\nSet AWG for a 1 kHz sine wave, 2V_{pp},\nObserve that scope waveforms should both\nbe sinusoidal and in phase with one another.\nChannel 2 should measure approximately \n2.4V_{pp}.\n\nReplace the dummy load with the DUT.\nRun the companion software to perform\na frequency sweep."
    (at 15.24 101.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6e02a4d9-09fe-488c-a50a-1ef8592506cb)
  )
  (text "Driver\nstage" (at 153.67 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 73cc934d-d4e4-4f11-9b73-7467d8404ff8)
  )
  (text "AWG" (at 16.51 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 7830eff2-c83f-4ac0-97c5-4a3b0914a3b5)
  )
  (text "Power entry\nand bypassing" (at 46.99 199.39 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 7b0170b2-7c37-4b44-858c-a50154068b57)
  )
  (text "Voltage sense amp\nA_{V} = 10 V/V" (at 220.98 57.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8b9bf974-6f8a-4c0f-ad3d-18efa9631c64)
  )
  (text "Unused\nop amp" (at 36.83 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9cf9939e-0a19-4999-95ee-b92b9306fbb3)
  )
  (text "Current sense amp\nr_{m} = 100 mV/mA" (at 224.79 111.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid adc1dd03-493b-49f0-96b3-04d332fb730e)
  )
  (text "Quiescent\ncurrent\nregulation" (at 114.3 148.59 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c9b36e4e-7f9b-457d-a805-343ce41d3d47)
  )
  (text "Rev. B: Interchange (+) and (-) inputs of current sense amp U102 to get correct sense of current.\nAdd voltage sense amp U103 so that voltage will be sensed with an identical circuit to avoid \nphase discrepancies. Change R112 and R113 from 1R and 1k to 10R and 11k respectively so that \nU102 and U103 will have matching gains.\nRev. C: Delete 1M0 resistor from pin 2 of U101 to ground."
    (at 162.56 167.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ccb53840-47d0-438a-870b-1f0af1f8476c)
  )
  (text "Output\nstage" (at 181.61 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d4d3015b-0e54-4a65-a780-76f76715ceaa)
  )
  (text "POWER\nSUPPLY" (at 13.97 180.34 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d8f389b0-07cd-4b9a-94ce-b533531bba37)
  )
  (text "Place one pair of 100 nF decoupling capacitors as close as possible to\npower pins of each IC."
    (at 19.05 186.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid fbb84cfa-fc12-4a74-a21e-5da975894a59)
  )
  (text "Input buffer and\nfeedback control\nA_{v} = -0.1V/V" (at 74.93 148.59 0)
    (effects (font (face "KiCad Font") (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid fc10b219-116a-4ba1-9fb9-6e54e3dc2c15)
  )

